      "text": "Re the regex, I get a lot of luck out of simple brutish patterns like:\n\n[Regex]::Matches($html, \"<table.+?/table>\", \"IgnoreCase\")\n\nThis will find all of the top level tables in a page.\n\n80% of the time, this will cleanly cast -as [xml].\n\nThen you just dot into the rows / columns."
